WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.959
thoughtful  gifts  are  about  more

00:01.959 --> 00:03.959
than  just  the  item.  They're  a  way

00:03.959 --> 00:06.160
to  say  I  see  you.

00:06.160 --> 00:07.960
Gift  makes  that  sentiment  easier

00:07.960 --> 00:10.120
to  express  turning  your  thoughtful

00:10.120 --> 00:12.679
intentions  into  meaningful  personal

00:12.679 --> 00:13.400
gifts.

00:13.801 --> 00:15.281
Whether  you  are  gifting  a  single

00:15.281 --> 00:18.120
friend,  a  visitor,  an  event,  or

00:18.120 --> 00:20.040
managing  your  entire  organization's

00:20.040 --> 00:22.561
needs,  gift  adapts.  From

00:22.561 --> 00:24.881
personalized  presents  to  teen  kits

00:24.881 --> 00:27.320
and  office  supplies,  every  gift

00:27.320 --> 00:29.001
tells  a  unique  story.

00:30.122 --> 00:32.121
Getting  started  is  simple.  Just

00:32.121 --> 00:33.881
share  your  recipient,  budget,  and

00:33.881 --> 00:35.522
deadline.  Once  you  approve  the

00:35.522 --> 00:37.002
design,  Arla  handles  the

00:37.002 --> 00:39.042
craftsmanship,  packaging,  and

00:39.042 --> 00:40.962
delivery,  ensuring  your  next

00:40.962 --> 00:43.082
gifting  project  is  effortless.

00:59.124 --> 01:02.364
Join  the  GYVT  community  and  unlock

01:02.364 --> 01:05.164
more  from  Arla.  Members  receive  5%

01:05.164 --> 01:07.364
off  eligible  regular  merchandise

01:07.364 --> 01:09.284
and  gain  priority  access  to  out

01:09.284 --> 01:11.204
of  stock  items,  extending  these

01:11.204 --> 01:13.004
benefits  to  everyone  you  invite  to

01:13.004 --> 01:13.964
your  circle.

01:14.245 --> 01:15.684
Ready  to  make  your  next  gift

01:15.684 --> 01:18.045
truly  personal?  Create  your  first

01:18.045 --> 01:21.925
circle  today  at  gyyftt.com.

01:21.925 --> 01:23.484
Gyyftt,

01:23.484 --> 01:25.645
your  story,  our  telling.
